drivercopy

# Cyrillic fork local inputs/outputs -- these live in the REPO ROOT and must
# never be committed (multi-GB ISOs and the donor CAB). Anchored to the root
# and case-insensitive (BASE4.CAB, *.iso, *_cyr.iso, ...).
/*.[iI][sS][oO]
/*.[cC][aA][bB]
